    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One thing that's bothering me is that the amounts are so random. They aren't even consistent multiples of anything, just these tiny, unpredictable amounts popping up in the middle of the month. It feels almost like they're intentionally trying to fly under the radar of our automated threshold alerts. \n\nDo you have any advice on how to look for the specific 'fingerprint' of these kinds of irregular entries? Like, how can I tell if this is just poor bookkeeping or if someone is actually manipulating the system in a subtle way?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
